  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb236693f9dbe47498f4dd7ccccbfbf3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q19
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InterviewQuestionData
  question: "Shader Graph trong URP: gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch PBR workflow l\xE0 g\xEC?"
  choices:
  - text: "PBR (Physically Based Rendering) m\xF4 ph\u1ECFng c\xE1ch \xE1nh s\xE1ng
      t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\xE1c v\u1EADt li\u1EC7u d\u1EF1a tr\xEAn v\u1EADt l\xFD.
      Workflow: Metallic (kim lo\u1EA1i/phi kim), Smoothness (\u0111\u1ED9 b\xF3ng),
      Normal Map (gi\u1EA3 chi ti\u1EBFt b\u1EC1 m\u1EB7t), Occlusion (b\xF3ng trong
      k\u1EBD n\u1EE9t), Emission. Shader Graph cho ph\xE9p t\u1EA1o custom shader
      kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n code, k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i node visual."
    score: 3
    feedbackHint: "Hi\u1EC3u PBR channels v\xE0 bi\u1EBFt Shader Graph."
  - text: "T\xF4i d\xF9ng standard material, Shader Graph t\xF4i ch\u01B0a h\u1ECDc
      nhi\u1EC1u."
    score: 1
    feedbackHint: "Ch\u01B0a \u0111\u1EA7u t\u01B0 h\u1ECDc rendering pipeline."
  - text: "PBR d\xF9ng texture nh\u01B0 Albedo, Normal, Metallic \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o
      v\u1EADt li\u1EC7u tr\xF4ng th\u1EF1c. Shader Graph d\xF9ng node thay code."
    score: 2
    feedbackHint: "Hi\u1EC3u c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n nh\u01B0ng ch\u01B0a gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch
      physics-based concept."
  category: URP
